;	000000000300093107	;	"	  DHEA+ Female Hormone Tonic   <ul>     <li><b>Nanoformulated DHEA+ Female Hormone Tonic</b> is a balanced blend of micronized DHEA, pregnenolone,       diindolylmethane, chrysin, and premium herbal extracts. The targeted formula is designed to support and       balance healthy hormone levels for women in the perimenopausal, menopausal, and postmenopausal stages of       life.</li>     <li><b>Healthy Aging Head to Toe</b> -Natural DHEA production peaks between the ages of 25 and 30. Supplementation       of this influential hormone supports healthy weight, energy, libido, and muscle maintenance. †</li>     <li><b>Balance for Vital Hormones</b> - This blend includes the “mother hormone” pregnenolone, a precursor to all lifeharmonizing       sex and stress hormones, and also tied to healthy cognitive function. † Chrysin and DIM support       healthy estrogen levels and metabolism, while adaptogenic herbs like ginseng and maca support healthy stress       resilience.*</li>     <li><b>Better Together </b> Supplementing with Nanoformulated DHEA+ Female Hormone Tonic during the day and our       Progesterone + Replenishing Serum at night can offer a welcomed balancing effect for a healthy mind and body.</li>   </ul>	"	;
;	000000000300093108	;	"	Topical Replenishing Serum    <ul>     <li>       Progesterone+ Replenishing Serum is our patent-pending, nanoemulsified,       topical progesterone serum providing 8 mg of bioidentical progesterone per       1mL serving. Our formula consists of a micronized form of progesterone,       housed in a nanoparticle phospholipid-base for enhanced absorption       compared to conventional creams.     </li>     <li>       Recommended Use: Apply 1mL (8mg Progesterone) to smooth skin areas such as       wrists, inner arms or thighs, neck, abdominal, chest once or twice daily,       or as directed by your healthcare practitioner. If pregnant, breastfeeding       or planning to become pregnant, consult your physician before use.     </li>     <li>       Our patent-pending Quicksilver Delivery Systems  improves upon liposomal       and emulsification technology with smaller, more stable particles made       from the highest grade ingredients available. † Our nanoformulated       Progesterone+ Replenishing Serum delivers fast and enhanced absorption of       progesterone, bypassing liver metabolism for optimal effects.     </li>     <li>       Progesterone+ Replenishing Serum does not contain parabens, mineral oil,       or petroleum.     </li>   </ul>	"	;
