;	000000000300094544	;	"	  <p><b>Ease Discomfort from Head to Toe</b><sup>*</sup></p>   <p>     <b>Full Spectrum Hemp Extract</b> – Our full spectrum hemp extract contains     an array of phytocannabinoids, including CBD, a Farm Bill-compliant level of     THC, and naturallyoccurring terpenes that interact with the endocannabinoid     system to help regulate signaling pathways in the body to ease joint,     muscle, and nerve discomfort.*   </p>   <p><b>Proprietary Curcumin + Boswellia</b>– These botanicals work synergistically to provide     additional support for physical irritations.<sup>*</sup></p>   <p><b>Proven for Better Absorption</b>– Our ground breaking capsule delivery system bypasses     absorption constraints posed by the gut, swiftly transporting soothing nutrients into your     bloodstream after ingestion, to offer rapid support. Proven for blood curcumin levels 10-30x     higher than leading ‘high bioavailability’ competitors.<sup>†</sup></p>	"	;
